+---
+# crew#539: scheduling immunity. The two PriorityClasses, the balloon and the Kyverno policy that
+# keeps the radio-room set honest. After edge (Kyverno CRDs); the rows that name
+# infrastructure-critical depend on this one so the class exists before a pod asks for it.
+apiVersion: kustomize.toolkit.fluxcd.io/v1
